<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Egmond aan Zee Guide: 21 places – beach, dunes, abbey &amp; day trips – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/egmond-aan-zee/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Egmond aan Zee beach</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Check the tides – the beach is widest at low tide, tight at high tide. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/egmond-aan-zee/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>4.62112,52.62528,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. North Holland Dune Reserve</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/egmond-aan-zee/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>4.6271,52.55242,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Egmond Abbey (Egmond-Binnen)</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Take your time – it is a place to settle, not to tick off. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/egmond-aan-zee/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>4.66004,52.595,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Bunker museum &amp; castle ruin</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Opening hours are on the respective museum websites – they vary by season. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/egmond-aan-zee/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>4.62282,52.62447,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Toast Egmond</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/egmond-aan-zee/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>4.62398,52.61822,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>14. Het Wapen van Egmond</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/egmond-aan-zee/#o14</description><Point><coordinates>4.62184,52.6177,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>15. Piet Kerssens – real baker</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/egmond-aan-zee/#o15</description><Point><coordinates>4.62364,52.61814,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>17. Alkmaar</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Arrive before 10 a.m. for the cheese market, otherwise you stand behind rows of people. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/egmond-aan-zee/#o17</description><Point><coordinates>4.75028,52.63156,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>18. Haarlem and Amsterdam</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/egmond-aan-zee/#o18</description><Point><coordinates>4.65762,52.35741,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>19. Zee Aquarium in Bergen aan Zee</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/egmond-aan-zee/#o19</description><Point><coordinates>4.62931,52.66043,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>21. Bergen &amp; Bergen aan Zee</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Combine the visit with a bike ride through the dune reserve. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/egmond-aan-zee/#o21</description><Point><coordinates>4.68066,52.66616,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
